Brute-force: Time - O(n2), Space - O(1)
Comparing each element i with other elements of array until n

Sort: Time - O(n*Log-n), Space - O(1)
Comparing the adjacent elements in a sorted array until n

HashSet: Time - O(n), Space - O(n)
Check for duplicates if the element i exists in a HashSet, else add to it.